WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.125 --> 00:00:01.960
- There's a film playing
across the street.

00:00:02.293 --> 00:00:03.586
- It's playing at 5:00.

00:00:03.586 --> 00:00:06.089
- We can make it. There's
going to be 5 minutes of trailers.

00:00:06.089 --> 00:00:07.465
- I want to get a good
seat, you know?

00:00:07.465 --> 00:00:10.385
- A good seat from which to 
watch Asgard burn.

00:00:10.385 --> 00:00:11.636
- Lets show some movies.

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:15.598
- We're here to heckle a movie!

00:00:15.598 --> 00:00:16.641
- 75 cents.

00:00:16.641 --> 00:00:18.476
- So what actually happens in this?

00:00:18.476 --> 00:00:21.187
- Movies are dreams that
you never forget.

00:00:22.147 --> 00:00:24.024
- Please retain your stub sir.

00:00:24.482 --> 00:00:25.942
- The refreshments are right over there.

00:00:25.942 --> 00:00:27.027
- Hey, uh, do you 
want anything?

00:00:27.027 --> 00:00:27.944
- Popcorn!

00:00:27.944 --> 00:00:28.987
- Butter or plain?

00:00:28.987 --> 00:00:29.904
- Extra butter.

00:00:29.904 --> 00:00:30.989
- Some Diet Coke please.

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:34.951
- This seat taken?

00:00:36.953 --> 00:00:37.746
- Not bad seats at all.

00:00:39.456 --> 00:00:40.623
- [Japanese]
Our film is starting.

00:00:40.623 --> 00:00:41.708
- Roll film!

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:51.634
- I missed a reel change.

00:00:55.597 --> 00:00:58.641
- [French] I like looking back at
people’s faces in the dark.

00:01:00.685 --> 00:01:01.770
- Sounds like a comedy.

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:02.645
- It's comedy...

00:01:03.646 --> 00:01:04.522
and sexy...

00:01:05.565 --> 00:01:06.566
...and it's action.

00:01:07.358 --> 00:01:08.026
- Gotcha!

00:01:08.318 --> 00:01:10.153
- Total entertainment experience.

00:01:21.206 --> 00:01:22.624
- Boy, did you see that?

00:01:22.624 --> 00:01:24.375
- I gotta see it again. Ernie?

